issuecomment-2507801174","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","id":2507801174,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VegJW","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T13:15:35Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T13:15:35Z","body":"> Regarding `NULL` termination, I'll link my proposal from just yesterday: [godotengine/godot-proposals#11249](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11249)\r\n> \r\n> Agree that's for another day. Thanks for thoroughly testing this PR! Can you explain the changes on a high level?\r\n\r\nNothing fancy, just do everything in one pass instead of two, and some small look ahead instead of one char per iteration with storing some state.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2507801174/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508158737","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826#issuecomment-2508158737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","id":2508158737,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vf3cR","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T16:59:59Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T16:59:59Z","body":"> Regarding tests, I had to remove the non standard ones, as it is now closer to standard. I replaced them with examples from the [unicode standard specification](https://www.unicode.org/versions/Unicode16.0.0/UnicodeStandard-16.0.pdf).\r\n\r\nDoes this mean that the new implementation fails the previous tests?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508158737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508167611","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826#issuecomment-2508167611","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","id":2508167611,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Vf5m7","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T17:07:49Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T17:08:04Z","body":"> Does this mean that the new implementation fails the previous tests?\r\n\r\nPrevious implementation was decoding overlongs, new one do not (can be changed by removing few `unicode = _replacement_char;` lines).\r\n\r\nWe also might want to decode unpaired surrogates, previous implementation was not doing it since #74760, but unpaired surrogates can be par of Windows file names, and we probably should be able to store/read them (not sure how common it is).\r\n\r\nBoth cases should still set the parsing error flag (since it's not valid UTF-8).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508167611/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508198287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826#issuecomment-2508198287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","id":2508198287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VgBGP","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T17:39:31Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T17:40:24Z","body":"> > Does this mean that the new implementation fails the previous tests?\r\n> \r\n> Previous implementation was decoding overlongs, new one do not (can be changed by removing few `unicode = _replacement_char;` lines).\r\n> \r\n> We also might want to decode unpaired surrogates, previous implementation was not doing it since #74760, but unpaired surrogates can be par of Windows file names, and we probably should be able to store/read them (not sure how common it is).\r\n> \r\n> Both cases should still set the parsing error flag (since it's not valid UTF-8).\r\n\r\nSeems like a user can manually name a file with an unpaired surrogate and windows will accept it. I see other issues in programming languages like [zig](https://github.com/ziglang/zig/issues/2565) and [go](https://github.com/golang/go/issues/32334) mitigating this by using [WTF-8 ](https://simonsapin.github.io/wtf-8/) instead of UTF-8. This would be a small change, it consists mostly of [accepting surrogates](https://simonsapin.github.io/wtf-8/#encoding-wtf-8) with a small transformation. This is probably better suited for another PR after this one though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2508198287/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2748447036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99826#issuecomment-2748447036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99826","id":2748447036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6j0fk8","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:32Z","updated_at":"2025-03-24T15:05:32Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://ap